For the next 72 hours on Arena, you can use GPT-Image-2.5 Sunburst directly at no cost.

@OpenAI’s latest image model was just  ranked #1 in the Text-to-Image Arena, the Image Edit Arena, and in the Multi-Image Edit Arena. Find the link below, select the model in Direct Mode, and test it directly for yourself!

Direct Mode lets users directly select models by name. Access to GPT-Image-2.5 Sunburst ends Sept. 13 at 8 a.m. PT. Afterward, it will remain available anonymously in Battle and Agent Mode. User votes from Battle and Agent Mode are used to power our real-world leaderboard rankings. In these modes, models are always anonymized.
